    {
      "id": "annotation_1",
      "provider": "annotation",
      "name": "Read this first",
      "config": {
        "content": "**Vector Explorer: PostgreSQL (pgvector)**\n\nThis pipeline is laid out for Vector Explorer. It has three sources: **Ingest** (drop files here to add documents), **Chat** (ask questions over them) and **Tools** (Vector Explorer's own calls). Start all three, save the pipeline as a project, then open Vector Explorer and choose the connection.\n\n`store_1` is the store Vector Explorer manages; `store_2` reads the same collection for the chat. Keep both on the same collection and connection settings.\n\n**Removing documents is on for `store_1`** (`allow_writes`). Turn it off to make Vector Explorer read-only for this store. Adding documents goes through the Ingest source: anyone who can send data to it can add documents.\n\nThe LLM node needs your key: replace `replace-with-your-key`, and set `base_url` only for an OpenAI-compatible server other than OpenAI.\n\n`chunk_1` cuts text into chunks of at most 1,000 characters (`strlen`); on mixed documents that gives a median chunk of about 800 characters, small enough for precise answers and a readable map.",
        "bgColor": "var(--rr-annotation-bg-default)",
        "fgColor": "var(--rr-text-primary)"
      },
      "ui": {
        "position": {
          "x": 40,
          "y": 520
        },
        "measured": {
          "width": 520,
          "height": 360
        },
        "nodeType": "annotation"
      }
    }
  ],
